cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the exact revision and the relevant mathematical companion."
title: "Fusion Ring Census: exact whole-rank enumeration and verification"
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/sebastienpalcoux/fusion-ring-census"
version: "0.4.0"
date-released: "2026-10-26"
authors:
  - family-names: "Palcoux"
    given-names: "Sébastien"
abstract: >-
  Released bounded datasets of based fusion rings at ranks 3 through 12, with
  full multiplication tensors, independent exact output verification,
  rank-specific mathematical companions and OEIS projections. Complete source
  and producer completion records accompany the high-rank datasets; the full
  searches were not independently repeated. No categorifiability filtering.
keywords:
  - fusion rings
  - exact enumeration
  - based rings
  - tensor categories
  - OEIS

